@startuml virtual_mtp_upload
title Browser Upload Through Virtual EF800 MTP
autonumber

actor Browser
participant "HTTP / WebSocket gateway" as Gateway
participant "EF800 Application native_sim" as Sim
participant "In-process USB host peer" as Peer
participant "Virtual UHC <-> UDC bus" as Bus
participant "Production MTP class" as MTP
database "Zephyr FS / FatFS" as FS

Browser -> Gateway : upload(storage, relative path, file)
Gateway -> Gateway : validate storage, path and transfer bound
Gateway -> Sim : bounded request and chunks
Sim -> Peer : enqueue request to USB worker context
Peer -> Bus : enumerate device and open MTP session
Bus -> MTP : object-info and object-data operations
MTP -> FS : stage private upload file
MTP -> FS : sync, close, publish final name
FS --> MTP : result
MTP --> Bus : MTP response
Bus --> Peer : transaction result
Peer --> Sim : completion + byte/checksum status
Sim --> Gateway : transfer completion/failure
Gateway --> Browser : final status

note over Peer, MTP
  Current native-sim enumeration may time out;
  this sequence describes intended behavior.
end note
@enduml
